<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by an innings and 196 runs on the fifth and final day of the first test on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302 and 130, Australia 628-8 declared.</p>
